                      00042 
                      00043 ; example of using Shared Uninitialized Data Section
                      00044 INT_VAR     UDATA_SHR   
0000                  00045 w_temp      RES     1       ; variable used for context saving
0001                  00046 status_temp RES     1       ; variable used for context saving
0002                  00047 pclath_temp RES     1       ; variable used for context saving
                      00048 
